{"type":"text","timestamp":1789782888332,"sessionID":"ses_f48a1272cffeVhdrtRhR69ox9F","part":{"id":"prt_0b75f885a0018SOi3yQa2fIPeF","messageID":"msg_0b75f7357001KZoq0cq3RVuS6r","sessionID":"ses_f48a1272cffeVhdrtRhR69ox9F","type":"text","text":"I found three causes: project detail reads skip membership checks, list cache keys omit the organization, and updates only invalidate a detail key. I’ll add the ownership check, scope list keys by organization, and invalidate all list variants for the updated project’s organization. List authorization already runs before cache lookup; I’ll preserve and test that behavior.\n","time":{"start":1789782886490,"end":1789782888330},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_02404173aa4db54e016aadeb66687487d1859c9d67b63d6596","phase":"commentary"}}}}
