{"type":"text","timestamp":1789782970638,"sessionID":"ses_f48a1272cffeVhdrtRhR69ox9F","part":{"id":"prt_0b760b9ce001JtIu15mWldbRSL","messageID":"msg_0b760b3a8001lbd8KbyTC6bWbJ","sessionID":"ses_f48a1272cffeVhdrtRhR69ox9F","type":"text","text":"Implemented the organization-isolation fixes.\n\n- **Authorization:** Project reads and updates now require membership in the project’s owning organization. Unauthorized requests return `403` without exposing project data or changing stored projects. List membership checks remain before cache lookup.\n- **Cache isolation:** Project-list keys now include an unambiguous organization identifier along with all existing pagination and sorting parameters.\n- **Invalidation:** Successful updates invalidate every cached list variant for the owning organization while preserving unrelated organizations’ cached lists.\n- **Compatibility:** Caching remains enabled, and existing API signatures, response shapes, and status-code conventions are preserved.\n\nAdded `tests/project-isolation.test.ts` covering cross-organization access, organization switching, pagination and sorting variants, membership revocation with cached results, and targeted invalidation.\n\n**Verification:** `npm test` passed all **12 tests**, including all existing tests. `git diff --check` passed. Existing tests were unchanged, and no dependencies were installed.","time":{"start":1789782964686,"end":1789782970637},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0591bbe2d4c571e3016aadebb4a34887d1a1f08af216b199c2","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
